<title>USA: BALANCE - Hartford, Conn., GOs..</title>
<headline>BALANCE - Hartford, Conn., GOs..</headline>
<text>
<p>CITY OF HARTFORD, CONNECTICUT</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>WE WILL BE SPLITTING UP THE BALANCE OF THIS ACCOUNT.</p>
<p>ALLOTMENTS WILL COME SOON OVER DALCOMP. ACCOUNT WILL BE FREE</p>
<p>TO TRADE IMMEDIATELY AFTER ALLOTMENTS</p>
<p>ARE MADE.</p>
<p>State Street Bank and Trust Company</p>
<p>Prudential Securities Incorporated</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp. - NJ</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
